{"sourceUrl":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/info/1003/10733.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:07.492517+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/info/1003/10733.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>根据《湘潭大学</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年同等学力人员申请硕士学位招生简章》和《湘潭大学</span><span>2027年材料科学与工程专业同等学力人员申请硕士学位招生简章》及我院实际工作情况</span><span>，现将</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>年同等学力人员资格审核和复试工作有关事项通知如下：</span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span>资格审核和复试的考生范围</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong><strong> </strong><span><span>在</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9月</span><span>4</span><span><span>日</span>-9月30日内，通过</span><span>全国同等学力人员申请硕士学位管理工作信息平台（网址：</span><span>https://tdxl.chsi.com.cn/tdxlsqxt/index.html）提交了学位申请的考生，具体名单见附件</span><span>1</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、资格审核和复试安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、线上提交资格审查材料</span></p>\n<p><span><span>请在</span><span>1</span></span><span>0月1</span><span>2</span><span>日前，</span><span>登录湘潭大学研究生报考服务系统（网址：</span><span> https://yzbm.xtu.edu.cn/logout），招生项目为<span>“</span></span><span>同等学力人员申请硕士学位</span><span><span>”</span><span>，</span></span><span>根据系统提示输入账号密码。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>账号为在</span><span>“全国同等学力人员申请硕士学位管理工作信息平台（网址：</span></span><span>https://tdxl.chsi.com.cn/tdxlsqxt/index.html）<span>”</span><span>注册生成的</span><span>“</span><span>注册ID</span><span>”</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>初始密码为有效居民身份证号码，居民身份证为</span>18位数字</span><span><span>（最后一位为</span><span>X的，X为大写）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>登</span><span>入</span><span>系统后，</span><span><span>点击</span><span>“线上资格审查”</span></span><span>，</span><span>根据系统提示</span><span>按要求上传</span><span>资格审查材料的扫描件，填写信息。上传并填写完成以后点击提交，待学院审核材料通过后，参加现场资格审查材料复核。</span></p>\n<p><span>2、资格审查材料复核</span></p>\n<p><span>我院于</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span>14</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>在</span><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span><span>B305</span></span><span>进行资格审核材料复核，请考生按要求准备材料，资格审核材料包括：</span></p>\n<p><span>①学历证书和学位证书（或所获国（境）外学位需提供教育部留学生服务中心认证证明）原件及复印件；</span></p>\n<p><span>②学位认证报告（或学位在线验证报告）打印页；</span></p>\n<p><span>③二代身份证原件及复印件；</span></p>\n<p><span>④《湘潭大学接受在职人员以同等学力申请硕士学位报名表》一式三份；</span></p>\n<p><span>⑤《湘潭大学接受在职人员以同等学力申请硕士学位相关要求告知书》；</span></p>\n<p><span>⑥英语水平证明原件及复印件；</span></p>\n<p><span>⑦已发表或出版与申请学位专业相关的学术论文、科研成果获奖证书及项目批准书等相关证明材料及复印件。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>资格审查材料复核未通过的考生将不能参加复试。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>3、复试安排</span></p>\n<p><span>通过资格审查材料复核的考生，将于</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span>15</span><span>：</span><span>30</span><span>在</span><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span><span>B309</span></span><span>，进行复试考核</span><span>，考核采取面试形式进行，考核全程录音录像。</span></p>\n<p><span>请考生加入学院（部）资格审核复试通知</span><span>Q</span><span>Q群（群号：</span><span>807307477</span><span><span>，加群请备注</span><span>“</span></span><span>注册</span><span>ID+真实姓名<span>”</span><span>），如有变动</span></span><span>请以</span><span>群通知为准。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、</span></strong><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、考生在复试过程中，应严格遵守国家有关法律法规和学校要求，诚实守信，严禁各种形式的违规和干扰考试秩序的行为。一经查实，按照相关规定严肃处理。</span></p>\n<p><span>2、资格审核和复试结束后，学院将在官网进行统一公示（学院监督电话：0</span><span>731-</span><span>58298498</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><span>3、资格审核和复试合格的考生，须在</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>10月</span></span><span>29</span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span>31</span><span><span>日（上午</span><span>8：00—12:00，下午2:30—5:30）期间进行</span></span><strong><span>现场确认和信息采集</span></strong><span><span>，具体安排见我院官网（网址：</span><span>https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/index.htm</span></span><span>）通知</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>湘潭大学</span><span>材料科学与工程</span><span>学院</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>10</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"a7c4468b36c9d55fc97300b76384f0e06d7f0672a240be40bcfa8163af0b85f2","textLength":1269,"sourceSha256":"4f97e77167f71112e5f570b5b3344e21f6ee189afe67a72cbad3666b11237813","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"同等学力报名信息.xls","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18189940"},{"name":"同等学力报名信息.xls","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18189940"},{"name":"同等学力报名信息.xls","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18189940"},{"name":"湘潭大学推荐免试攻读研究生现实表现情况表.docx","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18180328"},{"name":"湘潭大学2027年推荐免试招生诚信承诺书.pdf","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18180329"},{"name":"湘潭大学2027年研究生学费标准.pdf","url":"https://clxy.xtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1699072810&wbfileid=18180327"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d76a008256ae168bade2","title":"2026年湘潭大学材料科学与工程学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读硕士研究生工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:07.492517+00:00"}
